# The identity provider's full public URL (scheme, host, port): the one
# installation parameter that its hostname, its issuer and the configurator derive
# from, and the address of the HTTP entry point that serves it (ADR 0008). It is
# stated here and nowhere else: the build, the proofs and the tests read this file.
# This is the local engine's own address; it has no default for an adopter.
ANIMA_IDENTITY_PROVIDER_URL=https://localhost:8443
